  "title": "How I Am Adopting Voice in My Workflows as Part of A Multimodal Future",
  "summary": "I am Tolya. Fourteen years at Logitech and I’ve seen a lot - keyboards, mice, speakers, webcams and headsets. Over those many years, I’ve tracked the many ways people interact with the digital world - the way they navigate and engage with it. We’ve gone from text and graphical user interfaces to today’s multimodal inputs, [...]",
